    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">districtĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		distringo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a stretching out</i>,
